<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal futures trade interrupted.</title>
<headline>Portugal futures trade interrupted.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) has been interrupted since 1107 GMT due to technical problems and it was not known when trade would resume, a BDP official said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
